DESCRIPTION:(GM - would you mind forwarding to the commercial team?)\n\n
 \n\nHi all\,\n\n\n\nPaul and GM have invited me to present some addition
 al offerings and solutions that are well placed to help selected prospec
 ts.\n\n\n\nAs we start to encounter larger customers many will have chal
 lenges around processes and people\, not just technology.\n\n\n\nWhile w
 e want to keep our projects light and fast\, in some cases those custome
 rs may benefit from additional work on processes prior to the Halo techn
 ology deployment.\n\n\n\nI’ll be joined by Tim Mills\, founder of ITSM p
 eople. Together we will give you an overview of some packaged solutions 
 and explain what problems they solve.\n\n\n\nWe will present on the big 
 screen downstairs\; you’ll be able to ask as many questions as you want!
 \n\n\n\nShould you see it as a good fit both myself and Tim will persona
 lly support you on suitable opportunities moving forward.\n\n\n\nKind Re
 gards\n\n\n\nAdam Godfrey\n\n\n_________________________________________
 _______________________________________\nMicrosoft Teams Need help?<http
 s://aka.ms/JoinTeamsMeeting?omkt=en-GB>\nJoin the meeting now<https://te
 ams.microsoft.com/l/meetup-join/19%3ameeting_MjBkZjEyNmQtNDM0MC00YzgxLWE
 1YTQtOGZlOWM4Yjg3ZTJk%40thread.v2/0?context=%7b%22Tid%22%3a%226848414a-6
 183-4da7-ad0a-0c101bf14a17%22%2c%22Oid%22%3a%2200afb702-50d9-42b8-98ec-2
 d64d2639160%22%7d>\nMeeting ID: 362 490 657 342 0\nPasscode: X2nG6Nd7\n_
 _______________________________\nFor organisers: Meeting options<https:/
 /teams.microsoft.com/meetingOptions/?organizerId=00afb702-50d9-42b8-98ec
 -2d64d2639160&tenantId=6848414a-6183-4da7-ad0a-0c101bf14a17&threadId=19_
