DESCRIPTION:Hi Tracey\,\n\nI hope you had a lovely holiday?\nI appreciat
 e you're going to be very busy catching up and I hope this time is OK to
  meet with myself and David\, if not please do propose an alternative ti
 me.\n\nWe would like to meet as soon as is practical for you\, on your r
 eturn ideally before Wednesday\, to talk through some early observations
  from the SD&T review.\n\nWe need to seek some clarification and then co
 nfirm direction on them to help to progress further.\n\nIt would also be
  great to discuss any key milestones throughout this 8 weeks period betw
 een us to confirm/ check on progress.\n\nMany thanks\nTina\n\n\n________
