 ng\n\n\nHi All\,\n\nAgenda: Service and support – granular observability
 . How we deal with compromised / corrupt workspaces as well as DR / BCP 
 invocation.\n\nPlease forward on to whoever may have been missed and dec
 line if you do not need to attend.\n\nBest regards\nJudith\n\n__________
