DESCRIPTION:Good morning all\,\n\nIt's looking like this time suits the 
 majority of us right now.\n\nI will record it however.\n\nIn this initia
 l call it's an open chat on what we feel the future of ITSM frameworks a
 nd standards could look like. All in the attempt to have a joined up eff
 ort to initiate change and ultimately disruption to the current ways.\n\
 nKey objectives of the call.\n\n\n  1.\nIntros\n  2.\nAlignment\n  3.\nN
 ext steps\n\nSpeak soon.\nMatt\n\n\n\n__________________________________
 ______________________________________________\nMicrosoft Teams Need hel
 p?<https://aka.ms/JoinTeamsMeeting?omkt=en-GB>\nJoin the meeting now<htt
 ps://teams.microsoft.com/l/meetup-join/19%3ameeting_ZmQ5OTk3YzgtMGUyYi00
 MTdmLWE5YmUtYjRjNDU1Mzc4MjBj%40thread.v2/0?context=%7b%22Tid%22%3a%22e20
 fabbf-fb41-472d-b9d6-8e172d449770%22%2c%22Oid%22%3a%220e28836e-a46d-403a
 -87f3-7b143d3c980b%22%7d>\nMeeting ID: 324 957 685 522 0\nPasscode: hV32
 eC6f\n________________________________\nFor organisers: Meeting options<
